            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-03T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-10-04T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-02T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-03T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southerly 25 to 35 km/h turning southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching between 18 and 22.</text>
